Bbsus4]\n[Bb]\n[B]\n\n[Intro]\n[E5]\nTake\n\n[Verse]\n[E5]a look around and tell me what you can see\nI\nguess that all depends on exactly what you want it to be\nDon't\nknow all the answers everybody's running away,\nhey If you\nwant to win the game then you know it's a shame not to play\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Everybody gets carried away\n[D]Everybody's trying [D#]everyday to remind\n[A#]you (Ooo) Leave it behind\n[F]you\n[C]What's it take to see? [D#]\n[F]What's it take to believe [F#]right from wrong?\n[C#]Never going\n[G#]back where I've gone [A]Walk On\n\n[Outro 1]\n[D]\n[C][G/D][D]Walk On\n[D]\n[C][G/D][D]Walk On\n[D]\n[C][G/D][D]Walk On\n[D]\n[C]  [G/D]  [D]\n[D]\n[C]  [G/D]  [D]\n[D]\n[C][G/D][D]Walk On\n[D]\n[C][G/D][D]Walk On\n[D]\n[C]  [G/D]  [D]\n[D]\n[C]  [G/D]\n\n[Outro 2]\n[D]",
